name: blind-spot
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: an instrument's zero was a sightline limit, not a measurement —
  the surface it flattened through dropped the layer where the mass
  lived. Declares where the boundary WAS and the count the new view
  produced, so the next session does not read a quiet board as clean.
  Sibling of frontier: not "done at this layer" but "was never looking
  at this layer".
route: surface
